---
import "../styles/global.css";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../components/shared/Container.astro";
import Paragraph from "../components/shared/Paragraph.astro";
import Selar from "../components/sections/Selar.astro";
import Requirement from "../components/sections/Requirement.astro";
import Pagebreadcrumb from "../components/shared/Pagebreadcrumb.astro";
import Titlenew from "../components/shared/Titlenew.astro";

import {
  Mail,
  ShieldCheck,
  Terminal,
  Workflow,
  UserCog,
  FileLock2,
  BadgeCheck,
  KeyRound,
} from "lucide-astro";
---

<Layout title="CloudTweak - M365 Bootcamp - Week 2">
  <main class="flex flex-col gap-y-16 md:gap-y-24 overflow-hidden">
    <section class="relative py-24 overflow-hidden">
      <!-- Background Effects -->
      <div
        class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-[30rem] w-[30rem] rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 blur-3xl"
      >
      </div>
      <div
        class="absolute right-0 bottom-0 h-[25rem] w-[25rem] rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 blur-3xl"
      >
      </div>

      <Container className="relative z-10">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
          <span
            class="inline-flex
          items-center
          gap-2
          rounded-full
          border
          border-blue-500/20
          bg-blue-500/10
          px-5
          py-2
          text-sm
          font-medium
          text-blue-700
          dark:text-blue-300
          backdrop-blur-xl"
          >
            <BadgeCheck size={18} />
            Week 2 Curriculum
          </span>

          <h1
            class="mt-8
          text-5xl/tight
          md:text-6xl/tight
          font-bold
          tracking-tight
          text-heading-1"
          >
            Microsoft
            <span
              class="text-transparent
            bg-clip-text
            bg-gradient-to-r
            from-blue-600
            via-primary
            to-cyan-500"
            >
              Exchange Online
            </span>
          </h1>

          <Paragraph className="mt-8 text-lg">
            Week 2 focuses on Microsoft Exchange Online administration. Students
            will learn how organizations manage emails, mailboxes, mail flow,
            security, compliance, and email protection in enterprise Microsoft
            365 environments.
          </Paragraph>

          <Pagebreadcrumb active="weektwo" />
        </div>

        <!-- Cards -->
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mt-20">
          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14
              h-14
              rounded-2xl
              bg-gradient-to-br
              from-blue-500
              to-cyan-500
              text-white
              flex
              items-center
              justify-center"
              >
                <Mail size={26} />
              </div>

              <Titlenew>Exchange Admin Center (EAC)</Titlenew>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Students will learn how to navigate the Exchange Admin Center
              (EAC), which is the main portal used to manage Exchange Online.
              Topics include dashboards, recipients, mail flow, security
              settings, reports, and administrative tools.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/exchange/exchange-admin-center"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Exchange Admin Center Docs
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14
              h-14
              rounded-2xl
              bg-gradient-to-br
              from-indigo-500
              to-purple-500
              text-white
              flex
              items-center
              justify-center"
              >
                <Workflow size={26} />
              </div>

              <Titlenew>Mail Flow Rules</Titlenew>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Learn how organizations control the flow of emails using transport
              rules. Students will understand how administrators block spam,
              redirect messages, apply disclaimers, and automate email
              processing using mail flow rules.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/exchange/security-and-compliance/mail-flow-rules/mail-flow-rules"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Mail Flow Rules Documentation
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14
              h-14
              rounded-2xl
              bg-gradient-to-br
              from-green-500
              to-emerald-500
              text-white
              flex
              items-center
              justify-center"
              >
                <UserCog size={26} />
              </div>

              <Titlenew>User Mailbox & Recipient Management</Titlenew>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Students will learn how to create and manage mailboxes, shared
              mailboxes, distribution groups, contacts, and mail-enabled users.
              This section also covers mailbox permissions and delegation.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/exchange/recipients-in-exchange-online/manage-user-mailboxes/manage-user-mailboxes"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Mailbox Management Docs
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14
              h-14
              rounded-2xl
              bg-gradient-to-br
              from-red-500
              to-orange-500
              text-white
              flex
              items-center
              justify-center"
              >
                <ShieldCheck size={26} />
              </div>

              <Titlenew>Security & Protection Basics</Titlenew>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Learn the fundamentals of Exchange Online Protection (EOP), spam
              filtering, anti-malware policies, phishing protection, and how
              organizations secure business emails.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/defender-office-365/eop-about"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Exchange Security Documentation
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14
              h-14
              rounded-2xl
              bg-gradient-to-br
              from-pink-500
              to-rose-500
              text-white
              flex
              items-center
              justify-center"
              >
                <KeyRound size={26} />
              </div>

              <Titlenew>Email Authentication (SPF, DKIM & DMARC)</Titlenew>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Students will understand how email authentication works and why
              technologies like SPF, DKIM, and DMARC are important for
              preventing spoofing and phishing attacks. This section introduces
              DNS-based email security concepts.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/defender-office-365/email-authentication-about"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Email Authentication Docs
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14
              h-14
              rounded-2xl
              bg-gradient-to-br
              from-orange-400
              to-yellow-400
              text-white
              flex
              items-center
              justify-center"
              >
                <FileLock2 size={26} />
              </div>

              <Titlenew>Mailbox Policies & Compliance</Titlenew>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Learn how organizations apply retention policies, mailbox
              auditing, litigation hold, and compliance settings to protect
              business communications and meet regulatory requirements.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/exchange/security-and-compliance/in-place-and-litigation-holds"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Compliance Documentation
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl lg:col-span-2"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14
              h-14
              rounded-2xl
              bg-gradient-to-br
              from-slate-700
              to-slate-900
              text-white
              flex
              items-center
              justify-center"
              >
                <Terminal size={26} />
              </div>

              <Titlenew>Exchange PowerShell Scripting</Titlenew>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Students will be introduced to Exchange Online PowerShell, which
              administrators use to automate mailbox management, reporting,
              permissions, mail flow configuration, and large-scale
              administrative tasks.
            </Paragraph>

            <Paragraph className="mt-4">
              Basic PowerShell commands, connections, and real-world
              administration examples will be demonstrated from a
              beginner-friendly perspective.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/exchange/connect-to-exchange-online-powershell"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Exchange PowerShell Docs
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <Selar />
        <div class="pt-10">
          <Requirement />
        </div>
      </Container>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
